I tried to follow your guidelines but it seems that many parts are still not identifiable. Have I missed something or is it all that might be done in regard to the syntax?

Overall_model<-'

             SNFER=~ SNFER1 + SNFER2 + SNFER3 + SNFER4 + SNFER5

                SNFER1 ~~ SNFER2

             SNFEC =~ SNFEC1 + SNFEC2  + SNFEC4

             SNFEA =~ SNFEA2 + SNFEA3 + SNFEA4Rev+ SNFEA5

             SNFE =~ SNFER + SNFEC + SNFEA

             ELDIP <~ 1*ELDIP1 + ELDIP2 + ELDIP3 + ELDIP4 + ELDIP5 + ELDIP6

                ELDIP =~ 0  #create a phantom latent variables

                ELDIP ~~ ELDIP # free residual error

                ELDIP ~ ELDIP1 + ELDIP2 + ELDIP3 + ELDIP4 + ELDIP5 + ELDIP6

                ELDIP ~ a*SNFE

             ELDIR <~ 1*ELDIR1 + ELDIR2 + ELDIR3 + ELDIR4 + ELDIR5 + ELDIR6 + ELDIR7 + ELDIR8

                ELDIR =~ 0

                ELDIR ~~ ELDIR

                ELDIR ~ ELDIR1 + ELDIR2 + ELDIR3 + ELDIR4 + ELDIR5 + ELDIR6 + ELDIR7 + ELDIR8

                ELDIR ~ b*SNFE

             CTW=~ CTW1 + CTW3 + CTW4 + CTW5 + CTW7 + CTW8

                CTW1 ~~ CTW3

