Hello,

In Mplus, there is an FSDETERMINACY option which returns a value ranging from 0 to 1 that describes the performance of the factor scores in terms of their correlations between the estimated and true factor scores.  Is there an equivalent argument in lavaan?  If not, what is the best method for examining the quality of the factor scores derived from lavPredict()?  Thanks!

