> I saw the message - 8 cases were deleted due to missing values
>                                   in exogenous variable(s), while fixed. x=TRUE.-
>  what exactly should I do ?

If you set missing = "fiml.x", they will be retained.

Alternatively, if they remain listwise deleted, then look at the ?lavPredict help page for an example of how to merge your factor scores into the original data, even when the rows mismatch.

