You set equality constraints by using the same label for different model coefficients. For example, in your syntax, you might do this:

model15 <- 'F1 =~ NA*var1 + var2

             F2 =~ NA*var3

             F3 =~ NA*var4 + var5

             F1~~a*F3

             F1~~a*F2

             F2~~F3

             var3 ~~ 0*var3'
However, your model will still be not identified unless you eitehr fix factor variances or constrain some loadings.

